              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And when they drew near to Jerusalem and came to Bethphage, to the Mount of Olives, then Jesus sent two disciples, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saying to them, “Go into the village opposite you, and immediately you will find an ass tied, and a colt with her; untie them and bring them to me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any one says anything to you, you shall say, ‘The Lord has need of them,’ and he will send them immediately.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This took place to fulfil what was spoken by the prophet, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
