            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And when he entered the temple, the chief priests and the elders of the people came up to him as he was teaching, and said, “By what authority are you doing these things, and who gave you this authority?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus answered them, “I also will ask you a question; and if you tell me the answer, then I also will tell you by what authority I do these things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The baptism of John, whence was it? From heaven or from men?” And they argued with one another, “If we say, ‘From heaven,’ he will say to us, ‘Why then did you not believe him?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 11.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.14.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.76"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1.76",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But if we say, ‘From men,’ we are afraid of the multitude; for all hold that John was a prophet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So they answered Jesus, “We do not know.” And he said to them, “Neither will I tell you by what authority I do these things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
