            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Hear another parable. There was a householder who planted a vineyard, and set a hedge around it, and dug a wine press in it, and built a tower, and let it out to tenants, and went into another country. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 22.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " When the season of fruit drew near, he sent his servants to the tenants, to get his fruit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the tenants took his servants and beat one, killed another, and stoned another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again he sent other servants, more than the first; and they did the same to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterward he sent his son to them, saying, ‘They will respect my son.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when the tenants saw the son, they said to themselves, ‘This is the heir; come, let us kill him and have his inheritance.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they took him and cast him out of the vineyard, and killed him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When therefore the owner of the vineyard comes, what will he do to those tenants?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.21.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 21:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
